# Magnetic Snuffler: "return target Equipment card from your graveyard to the battlefield attached to this creature". Bot2 destroys Bot1's Thinking Cap
# on turn 2. On turn 3 the Snuffler enters and its trigger targets the Cap; in response Bot2 exiles the Snuffler with Swords to Plowshares. The trigger
# still resolves (its target is legal): the Cap returns to the battlefield, but with no creature to equip it enters unattached (CR 301.5e), and the
# Snuffler, gone, gets nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Thinking Cap
Magnetic Snuffler
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Shatter
Swords to Plowshares
Island x20

